---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT * FROM (SELECT a FROM t UNION ALL SELECT a FROM u) x WHERE a IN (SELECT a FROM u WHERE d = 'z') AND rand() > 0.5"
---
Join LeftSemi, (a#0 == a#5)
:- Filter (rand() > 0.5D)
:  +- Union
:     :- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0]
:     +- Project [a#3]
:        +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3, d#4] (shared #1)
+- Shift +2
   +- Project [a#3]
      +- Filter (d#4 == 'z')
         +- Shared #1, printed above
